From 19d06db1b1ab503685d2a93ae755c34b5a1649ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:39:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/15] Round 4: Merge a prepared static timeline with a small
 event heap

Sort releases and closure starts and ends once at preparation as packed
u64 keys that preserve the (tick, kind, index) order. Each candidate
walks this timeline with a cursor and merges it with a binary heap that
holds only service completions and clearance wakes, so the per-candidate
heap clone and the static pops disappear.

Workload: domain2 (48 full records, 100 trains, 300 closures), 11 samples.
Before median: 2.191 ms. After median: 1.320 ms. Speedup: 1.66x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
